{"server":"jp","storyId":"story_cerber_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_cerber_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"特大クッキー","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cerber_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"48cfa910c424e68860d7d57a97a1f8e58a7512b7c9ed54ead8c09f9dad5fe84d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ケオベの単純で素朴な一日。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"ロドス本艦\nヴァルカンの工房"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"ケーちゃん、ちょっといいかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お姉ちゃん？　どうしたの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お手伝い？　頑張るよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"いや、お手伝いではなくてね。装備のメンテナンス、最後にしたのはいつかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"え？　えっと……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょっと待ってね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"えーと……一、二……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（指を折って数えている）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"15日くらい前、かな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"そろそろヤバいな。今日は装備のメンテナンスをしよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"分かった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"前描いてあげたメンテナンスの手順図は持ってる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"あるよ！　なくしちゃいけないから、部屋に貼っておいたんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"なら……部屋にある工具と消耗品のストックは足りている？　不足しているならここから持って行くといい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫！　足りてるよ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"よし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあ、これから炉の火を落とすから、終わったらケーちゃんは先に部屋に戻って始めてて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"え？　消しちゃうの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、今日はボイラー室の点検とメンテナンスなんだ。今のうちに倉庫に行って注文しておいた材料を受け取りに行くから、炉を見てられないんだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"おいらが見てるよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"火を見るのは、ケーちゃんにはまだちょっと早いかな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、もう武器のメンテナンスを頼んだからね。違う？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"ほら、そろそろ行こうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"お昼は作ってあるから、出て行く時は持って行くんだよ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"帰ってきたらケーちゃんのところに行くから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うん、分かった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ヴァルカン","speakerId":"char_163_hpsts","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあ、後で。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"早く帰ってきてね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"あぁ……行っちゃった……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"おいら……何してようかなぁ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"……うーん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"とりあえず、部屋に戻って、お宝のメンテナンスをする！　それでお姉ちゃんが来るのを待つ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"宿舎エリア\nケオベの部屋"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"んーと……図には、植物油を使うって書いてる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"植物油？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"これ……かな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ラベルに書いてるのは――植……物……油……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"よし、当たってる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"それで、次は……えーと？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"んーと、植物油を見つけたから、その次は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"布に油をちょこっとだけつけて、お宝のピカピカしてるところに優しく食べさせるんだった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"そうそう、こうだこうだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"おいら超ハッキリ覚えてたよ！　お姉ちゃん褒めてくれるかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"えへへ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"頑張って終わらせて、お姉ちゃんにいっぱい褒めてもらおう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"前に全部できた時は、コマを作ってくれたからね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"今度は何だろうなぁ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"そういえば、油ってどんな味なんだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お宝の食べ物って言ってたよね。おいしいのかな？　ちょっとだけ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（指に油をつけて、なめる）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"――おえぇ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お宝はこんなのがおいしいのかぁ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"おいらは無理だなぁ。好みは一緒だと思ってたんだけどな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"フンだ、別にいいよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"続けよ続けよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"よし、終わったぁ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"次は何だっけ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、今度はピカピカしてないところに油を食べさせるのか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"でもこっちには別の油をあげなきゃいけなくて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うぅ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"ケオベがメンテナンスを始めてだいぶ経った後――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"もうすぐ終わりそうだけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お腹空いちゃったよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん。先にごはん食べよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"今日のお昼は――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"獣肉のステーキ！　それにソースのかかったマッシュポテト！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"わー！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"あむあむあむ！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ハァ……ごちそうさま！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"さすがお姉ちゃん、お料理も最高！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、もうちょっとだけ、足りないかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん、今は何時だろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"えっと、じゅ……11時15分……お昼だー！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"みんなのお昼ごはんの時間だよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ってことは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"やったぁ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"しゅっぱーつ！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:30 A.M.\nロドス食堂"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ごはんの時間はやっぱり人が多いや！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"今日はどんなお料理があるのかなぁ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん？　おー、おいしそう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"こっちのも！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クーリエ","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"ケオベちゃん、こんにちは。食べたいものはお決まりですか？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"えっとねー、ちょっと見てみるだけ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（ここにこんなにたくさんあるなら、きっと中にはもっとたくさんあるよね？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（よし、どうやって忍び込むか考えよ。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クーリエ","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"注文されないんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うん、やめておくよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クーリエ","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"はい、さようなら。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"クーリエよ、カウンター前の料理がもうすぐ来るゆえ、注意してくだされ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クーリエ","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"わかりました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クーリエ","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）彼女が来ました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）承知した。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"注意深く観察しないとチャンスにもピンチにも気付かないって、お姉ちゃんが言ってたもんね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"前回はちゃんと見てなかったから、入り口にいたおじさんにつまみ出されちゃったんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"今回はうまくやるぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"絶対、入ってやるんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"それは野菜スープじゃな、わらわの記憶が確かならば、真ん中のはずじゃ。あちらのクーリエがおる場所じゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった、ありがとう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（おいらが今いる場所の近くに扉があって……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（その扉のそばに綺麗なお姉ちゃんがいる。入る時にバレないようにしなきゃ。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（クマちゃんがお姉ちゃんと話してる。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（隣においしそうなものがいっぱいあるけど、見てる人がいる。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（もうちょっと遠くにちょっとだけ隙間が見えるけど、狭いな。おいらじゃムリ！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（やっぱり扉から、かな？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（でも、入り口は人がいっぱい通ってるからなぁ……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（うん、もうちょっと様子を見よう。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（よし、人が減ってきた。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（いなくなった！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（今だ！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（行くぞ！！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"おいしいごはん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"わああケーちゃんここに入ってきたらダメだよ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ダメなの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"ダメ！　扉に張ってある紙は見た？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"見たよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"赤いまん丸に斜めの線が描いてあった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"あとケーちゃんの顔も！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"それは「ケーちゃん進入禁止」って意味だよ、わかる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"わかるよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"わかるならなんで入ってくるの！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お腹空いた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"それならあそこに並んで注文してから食べて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お腹空いた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"と、とにかく、ケーちゃんは入ってきちゃダメなの！　あそこに並んで！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お腹空いた！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"えーっと、うーんと……わかった、グムがどうにかするから！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"でもどうしたら……うーん……あっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"ねえケーちゃん。もし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"グムがこのクッキーをあげたら、出ていくって約束してくれる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（くんくん）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"いいよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グム","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあ、はい……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ありがとう！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"しばらくして――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"クマちゃんがくれたクッキー、おいしかったぁ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"でもあれっぽっちじゃ足りないよ……お腹空いたー。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"クマちゃんごめんね。おいらやっぱりそこに隠してある、おいしいものいっぱい食べたいの！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"さっきは嬉しすぎて声が出ちゃったから、見つかっちゃった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"今度は同じ失敗はしないよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うーんと、まずは周りをちゃんと見ないと……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（扉の方にはあのお姉ちゃん以外、あんまり人はいないな？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（あれ扉が開いてる！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（わあ！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（中のあのカゴ、パンがいっぱい入ってる！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（ここまでいい匂いがする！　焼きたてほやほやみたいだ！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（食べたい！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"おいしいごはん、今行くよ！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"……あぅ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"おや、なんじゃなんじゃ、そんなに慌ておって。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（しまった、見つかった？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"えーっと……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"んーと、ううっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（どうしようどうしよう！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"お、おいら、トイレに行きたいんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"厠はあちらじゃ、標識が見えるじゃろう。青とピンクの人形が描いておる。分かるな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、そうなんだ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ありがとう、お姉ちゃん！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"構わぬ、次は間違えるでないぞ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"うん！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（ふぅ、なんとかごまかした。もし捕まって、ヴァルカンお姉ちゃんに知られたら、絶対怒られるよ。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"ギターノ、これでラストよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"おう、お疲れじゃのう、それは奥のノイルホーンのところじゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"……はいはい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"どうしたのじゃ？　何ぞあったか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょっとね。グムに噛まれたのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"ほう、おぬしたちはいつの間にそんなに仲が良くなったのかのう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"笑い事じゃないわよ、割と本気で痛いのよね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"フフッ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"おう、そうじゃった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"え？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"少ししたら入り口の準備スペースにレギュラーセットを二つ置いてほしいんじゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"ペローのための？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"そうじゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった。注文は通しとくわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"それにしても……いたた……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"もうしばらくしたら痺れるかもしれんぞ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"いやだな、勘弁してちょうだい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"冗談じゃよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたの冗談って冗談に聞こえないのよね。で、本当のところはどうなの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"冗談じゃと言うておろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ギターノ","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"早く注文を伝えてくるがよいわ。もうしばらくで仕事が終わる。ようやく遅い昼食じゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ジュナー","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"わかったわ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"よーし、今度こそ失敗しないぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"今はどんな感じかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"ラッキー！　誰もいないんじゃない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"あ、入り口のお姉ちゃんまでいなくなってる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"イェイ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"えっへへー！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","